**Additional context:**  
The inclusion decisions were made conservatively, selecting only those records that clearly describe a randomised 
controlled trial (RCT) involving adult heart‑failure patients and that evaluate a mobile‑health (smartphone, tablet, 
web‑based, SMS, or social‑media) education programme compared with usual care. All other entries were excluded because 
they either lacked an RCT design, did not focus on a mobile‑health education intervention, or did not target adult 
heart‑failure populations.</code>
