│ partners","abstract":"BACKGROUND Chronic heart failure (CHF) causes great suffering for both patients and their      │
│ partners. The aim of this study was to evaluate the effects of an integrated dyad care program with education and    │
│ psychosocial support to patients with CHF and their partners during a postdischarge period after acute deterioration │
