│ psychoeducation intervention (n = 84) delivered in 3 modules through nurse-led face-to-face counseling,              │
│ computer-based education, and other written teaching materials to assist dyads to develop problem-solving skills.    │
│ Follow-up assessments were completed after 3 and 12 months to assess perceived control, perceived health, depressive │
