**Additional context (if relevant):**                                                                                   
- The inclusion decisions were driven by the presence of (i) a randomised controlled design, (ii) adult heart‑failure   
participants, and (iii) an mHealth‑delivered education component (tablet/computer/web‑based apps, SMS, smartphone apps, 
or similar).                                                                                                            
- Studies that were purely telemonitoring, medication‑reminder, or disease‑management without an explicit               
education‑delivery via mobile or web technology were excluded.                                                          
- Protocol papers, reviews, feasibility pilots without randomisation, or interventions focusing on non‑HF populations   
were also excluded.                                                                                                     
